 Test releases are experimental and do not establish real-vehicle compatibility.
 
+## [v0.1.24-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R37 — local projection interaction candidate; hardware validation pending.
+
+### English
+- Add local page swipes, directional focus with GPU ring, and frame-confirmed selection.
+- Cancel ambiguous multi-contact gestures instead of synthesizing taps or map gestures.
+- Repair the R36 renderer formatting blocker without disabling lint.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 新增本地页面滑动切换、旋钮方向焦点及 GPU 描边，确认操作须等待对应画面发送。
+- 多指状态不明确时取消本地手势，不误触地图或音乐按钮。
+- 修复 R36 渲染器格式检查阻塞，保留严格检查。
+
 ## [v0.1.23-test.1] - 2026-11-25
 
 > R36 — projected glass material and interaction candidate; no Android/receiver validation.
